    unfold sourceLemma36CPrime at hvC
    simp only [Walk.support_cons, List.mem_cons] at hvC
    rcases hvC with hvy | hvw
    · exact hv (hvy ▸ hypiece)
    rcases hvw with hv_eq_w | hvP
    · exact hvw hv_eq_w
    · exact hv (hPpiece v hvP)

