assert the literal source k-subgraph conclusion or its Section-2 consequences. -/
theorem sourceLemma39_branch_dichotomy_complete
    [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] {r : V} (C : G.Walk r r)
    (hLongest : SourceLongestCycle G C) (k : ℕ) (hk : 1 ≤ k)
    (hconn : VertexConnectivityAtLeast G 4) (hgirth : 5 ≤ G.girth)
